# NOT ignored: privionyx.xcodeproj/.../swiftpm/Package.resolved.
#
# Ignoring it is the convention for a Swift *package*, whose dependents are entitled to pick
# their own versions. An app is the opposite case: it is the thing being shipped, and the
# resolved file is the only record of which revision of the Google Mobile Ads SDK is inside
# the binary users install. Without it every build resolves afresh and a shipped app is
# whatever the SDK's authors tagged that morning.
#
# Xcode Cloud settles the argument regardless — it disables automatic resolution and fails
# the build outright if this file is absent.

# Local LiteRT-LM Swift package clone (on-device Gemma runtime).
# Referenced as a local package by the Xcode project. Not committed (large, has its
# own nested .git). To rebuild on another machine: clone google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM
# into LiteRT-LM/LiteRT-LM and `git checkout v0.13.1`.
LiteRT-LM/

